<task id="040" project="code-quality-and-assurance-r3">
  <metadata>
    <title>Forcing-function: expand Spaarke.ArchTests into fitness functions</title>
    <phase>4 Forcing-Functions</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Adds enforced architectural fitness tests (touches tests/**) — TEST-MODIFYING override → code-review + adr-check unconditionally.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Encoding architectural invariants as fitness functions (facade, downcast, layer-dependency, God-class thresholds) requires ADR-precise judgment; Opus.</model-tier-reason>
